00:55:47.840 --> 00:55:51.320
and the cognitive evolution literature

00:55:51.320 --> 00:55:55.810
on these spatial manipulation...

00:55:55.810 --> 00:55:57.340
Evolution of spatial manipulation,

00:55:57.340 --> 00:56:00.910
evolution of stone tools,
and the combination

00:56:00.910 --> 00:56:04.180
