00:59:48.470 --> 00:59:50.590
and it's just so helpful for a child

00:59:50.590 --> 00:59:53.303
just on the ratio of knowledge.

00:59:56.150 --> 00:59:57.600
My question is...

01:00:00.890 --> 01:00:05.010
I've seen children here that
